  entryId: MetalDoor
  title: Crumpled Note
  bodyText: "I found a strange card laying around, the color has long faded. But
    there\u2019s a door hidden deep into the cave. Metal, old but working. I stuck
    the card in a strange slot and it opened, i am going in and taking the card with
    me, don't follow."
